Schedule this briefing to run automatically:
- Weekdays (Mon-Fri): 7:00 AM, 12:00 PM, 3:00 PM, 6:00 PM
- Weekends (Sat-Sun): 12:00 PM and 6:00 PM
- First run of day (7AM weekdays, 12PM weekends) scans back to previous day 6PM. All other runs scan back to the the previous run that day.
