SLACK
  Direct Mentions: [items or None since last briefing]
  Hi-Priority Activity: [items or None since last briefing]
  Channel Highlights: [by channel, skip quiet ones]

EMAIL
  Action Required: [items or None since last briefing]
  FYI: [digest]
